rong>: Anonymous functions trong stack traces</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Reassignment Bugs</stro=
ng>: Functions losing reference to themselves</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Recursive Challenges</s=
trong>: Self-calling functions breaking when moved</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Code Maintenance</stron=
